{"data":[{"author_id":"1989516198363717632","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:19:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110390128141037907"],"id":"2110390128141037907","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":130,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"M2、社融、贷款，经常被混成一个词，\n其实是三个水位计。\nM2看社会上钱的总量，\n贷款看银行借出去了多少，\n社融看企业和政府从整个金融体系融到了多少钱。\nM2涨但社融弱，\n往往说明钱在金融系统里转，\n还没真正流进实体生意里。","url":"https://x.com/choiceone88/status/2110390128141037907"},{"author_id":"1273296208987959296","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:13:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110675472459960649"],"id":"2110675472459960649","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":38,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9 月中国的社融数据，依然是新增社融↑\n\n新增人民币贷款↓\n\n贷款中，居民、企业全部下跌\n\n社融靠政府发债支撑\n\n显示出从土地财政到债务财政的转化\n\n一方面限制政府发债，一方面地方政府用城投的方式借债\n\n当然城投现在也是越来越难借到了\n\n就看什么时候发债会被迫放开额度，不放开就拖工资，苦一苦百姓","url":"https://x.com/jianjun88435910/status/2110675472459960649"},{"author_id":"2071871914533068800","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:30:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110740001327861866"],"id":"2110740001327861866","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":228,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国9月新增社融3.55万亿元，居民端仍弱","url":"https://x.com/swordBluesy/status/2110740001327861866"},{"author_id":"73251735","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110687881824202906"],"id":"2110687881824202906","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9月新增社融约3.55万亿元，单看总量还可以。但拉长到前三季度，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款同比少增约3.04万亿元，企业债券净融资则同比多增约1.18万亿元。\n所以社融这道题，不能只看“加了多少”，还要看钱通过什么渠道出去、实体愿不愿意借。","url":"https://x.com/Blympie/status/2110687881824202906"},{"author_id":"2058818302311600128","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110687881882722379"],"id":"2110687881882722379","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"9月新增社融约3.55万亿元，单看总量还可以。但拉长到前三季度，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款同比少增约3.04万亿元，企业债券净融资则同比多增约1.18万亿元。\n所以社融这道题，不能只看“加了多少”，还要看钱通过什么渠道出去、实体愿不愿意借。","url":"https://x.com/WilliamZyovo/status/2110687881882722379"},{"author_id":"1871754217498836992","created_at":"2026-10-14T22:44:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110502098546946543"],"id":"2110502098546946543","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行最新公布2026年前三季度金融数据：9月末社融存量达468.17万亿元（同比增长7.1%），前三季度社融累计增量27.46万亿元，人民币贷款增加11.52万亿元。信贷总量平稳扩张的同时，债券与股票等直接融资占比明显提速，折射出国内资金流向与融资结构的深层调整","url":"https://x.com/red192393/status/2110502098546946543"},{"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-14T23:24:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110512088758272238"],"id":"2110512088758272238","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":319,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国 9 月社融新增 3.55 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 1.08 万亿，环比双双大幅回升，M2 同比增加 7.2%\n\n中国 9 月社融新增 3.55 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 1.08 万亿，环比双双大幅回升，M2 同比增","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2110512088758272238"},{"author_id":"2054370712480108544","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:27:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110316610124939759"],"id":"2110316610124939759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国 9 月金融数据出来，和上午的物价数据是同一个故事。\n\n· M2 同比 +7.2%，M1 同比 +3.2% —— 剪刀差 4.0 个百分点\n· M0 同比 +10.6%，是三个口径里最快的\n· 1–9 月社融增量 27.46 万亿元，去年同期 23.91 万亿元\n· 9 月单月：社融约 3.55 万亿元，新增人民币贷款约 1.08 万亿元\n\n三个观察：","url":"https://x.com/INVESTMINGX/status/2110316610124939759"},{"author_id":"1449103717081370630","created_at":"2026-10-14T16:24:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110406380427550881"],"id":"2110406380427550881","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"前三季度社融增量 27.46 万亿元，人民币贷款新增 11.52 万亿元，总量同比回落。融资结构发生显著变化，直接融资占比抬升并超过信贷，政府债券成为社融第一支柱，企业债券、股权融资回暖。信贷呈现明显分化：企业部门加杠杆托底信贷总量，但住户贷款净减少 1.03","url":"https://x.com/Rishav2924/status/2110406380427550881"},{"author_id":"1447499448649601025","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:53:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110353293432250433"],"id":"2110353293432250433","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":3978,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":4},"text":"9月社融数据也是刚出，可以说中国前三季度社融同比少了2.63万亿元，拆开来看，居民贷款从去年净增1.1万亿元，变成了净减1.03万亿元，增量同比少了约2.13万亿元，企事业单位贷款少增8900亿元，其中中长期贷款少增1.76万亿元。","url":"https://x.com/LVTGW666/status/2110353293432250433"},{"author_id":"1896761185938345984","created_at":"2026-10-15T00:04:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110522162981548407"],"id":"2110522162981548407","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🎊社融数据很漂亮，企业借钱积极忙。\n唯独居民躺平观望，不想借钱加杠杆。\n企业：我要搞生产；居民：我先苟住再说。","url":"https://x.com/haotianche21370/status/2110522162981548407"},{"author_id":"1982982157162426372","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:42:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110229679269630287"],"id":"2110229679269630287","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"数据点评：最新CPI温和，给了政策更从容的空间。但市场更关心政策何时兑现成信用扩张，光有预期不够，要看社融。 #A股","url":"https://x.com/jack1191484/status/2110229679269630287"},{"author_id":"1986369265130430464","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:41:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110546599063777454"],"id":"2110546599063777454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"信用端在收缩\n\n社融存量同比 7.1%、M1 3.2%（央行 10/14 发布）。\n融资余额指数 102.6 创年内新低，\n两融较 6 月高点回落近 4700 亿，\n权益基金周发行仅 12 亿。\n\n信心在哪？","url":"https://x.com/wang_yi59336/status/2110546599063777454"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110532776202014720"]},"author_id":"1692431366494064640","created_at":"2026-10-15T00:46:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110532803427209638"],"id":"2110532803427209638","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行公布了前三季度金融数据，上了腾讯的热搜。报告很长，术语很多，普通人不用啃全文，盯住三个数就行。 https://t.co/vJ6lvwnZhK","url":"https://x.com/LJanemy52737/status/2110532803427209638"},{"author_id":"1550195095793958913","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:37:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110364426281099766"],"id":"2110364426281099766","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":58,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国人民银行数据显示，9月末社融存量为468.17万亿元，同比增长7.1%。\n\n其中，对实体经济发放的人民币贷款余额279.9万亿元，同比增长4.8%。\n\n如果这个趋势持续到年底，中国经济2027年应该要好起来了。","url":"https://x.com/theRemyLi/status/2110364426281099766"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110714505038905345"]},"author_id":"1210756416652242944","created_at":"2026-10-15T19:48:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110820001599128024"],"id":"2110820001599128024","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":75,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年9月，社会融资规模存量同比增长7.1%，M2同比增长7.2%，社融增速慢于M2增速0.1个百分点，货币投放尚未充分转化为实体信用，但剪刀差较上月收紧0.2个百分点。\n来源：边际Lab x FinGraph财经图集 https://t.co/mQb1UZP3ix","url":"https://x.com/fingraph66/status/2110820001599128024"},{"author_id":"1705676935949594624","created_at":"2026-10-15T04:52:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110594729637458016"],"id":"2110594729637458016","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行前三季度金融数据出炉：9月末M2同比7.2%、社融存量同比7.1%，债股融资占比49.48%、反超贷款约7个百分点。钱换道了——企业借钱不再只走银行贷款这根水管，紧盯信贷单指标会看走眼；券商承销和直接融资端才是真动了。#财经 #货币政策","url":"https://x.com/caixunexpress/status/2110594729637458016"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110612907952386048","3_2110612908925468672"]},"author_id":"1486571626661437440","created_at":"2026-10-15T06:10:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110614212523553037"],"id":"2110614212523553037","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4490,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":6},"text":"9月金融数据：贷款增速4.8%，居民新增贷款为零\n\n9月末，人民币贷款余额同比增长4.8%，8月是4.9%。有记录以来最低（路透）。\n\n前三季度，人民币贷款增加11.52万亿元，去年同期是14.75万亿元。 https://t.co/HdAxNndG50","url":"https://x.com/Yelvlv930/status/2110614212523553037"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110310590791249920","3_2110310590799548416","3_2110310590816428032"]},"author_id":"1401412511614767107","created_at":"2026-10-14T10:03:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110310622525366720"],"id":"2110310622525366720","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":796,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":46},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2099642290885296397","type":"quoted"}],"text":"中共公布9月 #社会融资 数据：\n➡️#社融 增3.55万亿，人民币贷款增1.08万亿；政府债券融资1.53万亿！\n➡️#M2 7.3%，#M1 3.2%，剪刀差再扩大！\n➡️居民部门：短期贷款减少-900亿，中长期增874亿。\n➡️企业部门：短期增4600亿，中长期增8900亿。\n社会融资的增速、M2和M1都在下降！ https://t.co/UaaGtJZKr7 https://t.co/E6nygRBlOU","url":"https://x.com/justice_trail/status/2110310622525366720"},{"author_id":"1990030666453655552","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:04:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110537288413516231"],"id":"2110537288413516231","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":402,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行数据曝光+美联储突发利空！今天A股大盘将面临3741点生死战！ 📊⚠️\n\n昨天的两市暴跌（超4300只个股下跌，中位数-1.93%）只是前戏，昨晚夜间迎来的三大利空组合拳，才是决定今天甚至短期走势的关键：\n🔍 核心利空拆解：\n利空一：社融数据揭示“融资市”本质。","url":"https://x.com/N2qMo8KlRY604/status/2110537288413516231"},{"author_id":"3302713589","created_at":"2026-10-14T06:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110253017429864448"],"id":"2110253017429864448","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股最近表现弱势就三句话：\n\n钱在撤。​ 近20日沪市主力资金净流出约1808亿、创业板约718亿，没人接盘。\n\n经济偏冷。​ 8月社融增量同比降9.96%，房地产投资-19.9%、汽车消费-13.9%；9月制造业PMI 50.1刚踩荣枯线，非制造业新订单46.5仍在收缩。地产和消费两大引擎还没点火。\n\n杀估值不杀业绩。","url":"https://x.com/Maksek1234/status/2110253017429864448"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110365249412952064"]},"author_id":"1768147099370029056","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:42:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110365587335516651"],"id":"2110365587335516651","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"币界网美股消息报道，美国9月消费者物价指数（CPI）同比增长3.7%，核心CPI同比增长2.6%，均超出市场预期，导致10月加息预期飙升。与此同时，中国9月社融新增3.55万亿元，人民币贷款新增1.08万亿元，环比双双大幅回升。日经225指数收跌0.05%，沪指收跌0.88%，恒指收跌0.13%。\n@528btc #币界网 #cpi https://t.co/8RaqLHfYsi","url":"https://x.com/xiyan555084/status/2110365587335516651"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110350620234514433"]},"author_id":"464646709","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:43:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110350689054675175"],"id":"2110350689054675175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"收盘以后，央行公布经济数据，注意几个要点：\n\n1、信贷从\"冰点\"回到正常， 8月新增贷款仅600亿，9月回到1.08万亿，对股市是利好；\n\n2、 融资结构\"换锚\"仍在深化。1-9月债券+股票融资占社融增量49.48%，超过贷款约7个百分点，说明资本市场正在取代银行，直白一点就是融资市场，你们懂的！ https://t.co/zlgcpqeuJt","url":"https://x.com/peralta29r/status/2110350689054675175"},{"author_id":"852245268389126144","created_at":"2026-10-14T11:27:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110331756348080402"],"id":"2110331756348080402","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":24666,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":4},"text":"收盘以后，央行公布经济数据，注意几个要点：\n1、信贷从\"冰点\"回到正常，​ 8月新增贷款仅600亿，9月回到1.08万亿，对股市是利好；\n2、 融资结构\"换锚\"仍在深化。1-9月债券+股票融资占社融增量49.48%，超过贷款约7个百分点，说明资本市场正在取代银行，直白一点就是融资市场，你们懂的！","url":"https://x.com/Jwaher49783608/status/2110331756348080402"},{"author_id":"2030893341362249728","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:44:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110305812388204693"],"id":"2110305812388204693","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"央行投放7000亿，M2增长7.2%，为什么投资者还没明显热起来？\n\n关键在于：钱的总量和钱的流动速度，是两回事。\n\n9月末，M2同比增长7.2%，M1却只有3.2%，两者相差4个百分点。社融存量增长7.1%，实体人民币贷款余额增速仅4.8%，政府债券余额增速则达到13.7%。数据来源⁠￼","url":"https://x.com/lwqbepk/status/2110305812388204693"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2110532776202014720","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110714505038905345","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110612907952386048","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110612908925468672","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110310590791249920","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110310590799548416","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2110310590816428032","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"13_2110365249412952064","type":"video"},{"media_key":"3_2110350620234514433","type":"photo"}],"users":[{"id":"1989516198363717632","name":"one choice","username":"choiceone88"},{"id":"1273296208987959296","name":"jianjun","username":"jianjun88435910"},{"id":"2071871914533068800","name":"剑的 AI 实验室","username":"swordBluesy"},{"id":"73251735","name":"Nolan（互关版）","username":"Blympie"},{"id":"2058818302311600128","name":"William Z","username":"WilliamZyovo"},{"id":"1871754217498836992","name":"慢跑者","username":"red192393"},{"id":"2869390354","name":"Fox","username":"jhdxhl"},{"id":"2054370712480108544","name":"MING","username":"INVESTMINGX"},{"id":"1449103717081370630","name":"Crypto Visionary 美股＆Ai","username":"Rishav2924"},{"id":"1447499448649601025","name":"利维坦冲浪里","username":"LVTGW666"},{"id":"1896761185938345984","name":"土三哥观察分享","username":"haotianche21370"},{"id":"1982982157162426372","name":"Jack·A股宏观","username":"jack1191484"},{"id":"1986369265130430464","name":"Ethan","username":"wang_yi59336"},{"id":"1692431366494064640","name":"艾琳","username":"LJanemy52737"},{"id":"1550195095793958913","name":"Remy Li🚀","username":"theRemyLi"},{"id":"1210756416652242944","name":"FinGraph财经图集","username":"fingraph66"},{"id":"1705